      "id": "subtitle",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 42,
      "y": 108,
      "width": 1348,
      "height": 45,
      "text": "AI-assisted insurance claim verification. Customers file claims and upload PDFs directly to private Amazon S3; Amazon Bedrock reads each\ndocument, rules compare it with the claim, and a person makes every decision. Built without the AWS SDK on an AWS Free-plan account (ap-southeast-2).",
      "originalText": "AI-assisted insurance claim verification. Customers file claims and upload PDFs directly to private Amazon S3; Amazon Bedrock reads each\ndocument, rules compare it with the claim, and a person makes every decision. Built without the AWS SDK on an AWS Free-plan account (ap-southeast-2).",
