      "y": 1520,
      "width": 355,
      "height": 94,
      "text": "• PDFs never pass through the web server\n• No AWS credentials or API key in the browser\n• Repeated submissions return the same claim\n• Each claim is processed exactly once\n• AI never approves, rejects or alleges fraud",
